The Work is the interactive companion to Iturralde, P. (2026), "The cellular
lining of a continuous fluid compartment: an interstitial cell atlas and the
Interstitial Hydraulic Gating hypothesis," submitted to Fluids and Barriers of
the CNS. CC BY 4.0 was chosen to match that journal's open-access terms, so a
reader can open the model and reproduce or contradict Figures 3 and 4.

